<Layout
  title="About ReelsDrop"
  description="The story behind ReelsDrop — turning celebrations into instant, shareable memories."
  pubDate={new Date()}
>
  <p>
    ReelsDrop was born from a simple but deeply personal feeling — being far away from the people who
    matter most. In today’s world, families, cousins, and lifelong friends are often separated by
    cities, countries, and time zones. A single photo just isn’t enough to capture the laughter,
    dancing, and emotion of a celebration.
  </p>

  <p>
    We wanted parents in India, relatives overseas, and friends who couldn’t attend to feel the joy
    <em>as it happens</em>. Not days later. Not after the event ends. Right now — in real time.
    That’s where ReelsDrop comes in.
  </p>

  <p>
    We attend weddings, birthdays, parties, brand launches, and celebrations with a discreet,
    non-intrusive approach. No big cameras. No flashing lights. Just phones and pocket cameras that
    let moments unfold naturally. While the celebration continues, we edit those real moments live
    into polished, vertical reels — ready for Instagram, TikTok, and YouTube Shorts.
  </p>

  <p>
    By the time the music fades and the hugs begin, your reels are already delivered. Shared.
    Loved. Felt by everyone — near or far.
  </p>

  <p>
    ReelsDrop isn’t just about content. It’s about connection. It’s about letting your loved ones
    experience the vibe, the energy, and the emotion — instantly. Because the best moments shouldn’t
    wait.
  </p>
</Layout>